 \n\nAdvance Tickets: https://wiggleroomtoronto.com/event/rise-mandiz-mont
 real-barroness/\nEarly Wiggler: $15\nThe Wiggler: $20\n\nRISE - proper ho
 use music with DJs who know how to move a room.\nBuilt with intention — c
 reating space\, shifting balance\, and pushing the culture forward withou
 t making a spectacle of it.\nWiggle Room is a Safer Dance Space\, where r
 espect on the floor matters as much as what comes through the speakers.\n
 Come for the music. Stay for the energy.\n~ RISE ~\n\nPerformances:\n10-1
 1:30 ASLI\n11:30-1 Barroness\n1-3:30 Mandiz\n3:30-close Cozmic Cat\nVJ SE
