DESCRIPTION:👻 Hey Halloween Crew\, get those costumes ready! 🎃\n🗓️ Sat\, October 24 | 11 AM – 3 PM\n \n📍Pick up your Halloween bag* & Event Guide* at any of the 2 BIA Stations –1- St. Olave’s Church\, 360 Windermere Ave. & Bloor St W 2- La Petite École\, 130 Kennedy Ave & Bloor St W \nVillage-Wide FREE Family Activities*:\n• Trick-or-Treat Trail with 50 + businesses | 11 AM – 1 PM\n• Village-Wide Scavenger Hunt! Complete for chance to WIN 1 of 2 Grand Prizes (valued at $100) or 1 of 10 $20 gift cards!\n• Pumpkin Giveaway\, courtesy of Gillian Ritchie Red Square Team (RLP)\n• Professional Digital Photo on a Fall Backdrop\n• Kids Crafts\, courtesy of Denova Group (Dominion Lending)\n• Dog Costume/ Toy Swap  & all extras will be donated\n• Crafts by 4 Cats Art Studio and visit Treat Accessibly station\n• Costumed Characters\, Music\n• Seasonal Food\, Drink\, Shopping Promotions & In-Store Experiences\n• Guided Fall Leaves Walking Tour | 9 AM – 11 AM (registration closed now) \n(*while supplies last) \n🔴 Note: Trick-or-Treating will take place from 11 AM – 1 PM or while supplies last. Other activities\, arts\, crafts\, entertainment and Scavenger Hunt will take place until 3 PM. 🔴 \nThank you to our Sponsors and Community Partners –\nGillian Ritchie Red Square Team (Royal Le Page)\, Denova Group (Dominion Lending Centres National Ltd.)\, Meridian Credit Union\, Doggieland\, St. Olave’s Church\, The Creative Nest\, 4 Cats Art Studio\, Treat Accessibly\, La Petite École\, Village Holdings Corporation\, D&D Party Rentals \nDownload Digital Activity Guide!\nSubmit your Scavenger Hunt Answers!\nSubmit your details to receive Digital Photo from today!
