SUMMARY:Eglinton West to Riverdale Farm
DESCRIPTION:Toronto Bike Meetup\nSlow bike ride\, Meet at Ben Nobleman Par
 k 11 AM. Ride the beltline trail to the Farmers Market at the Brickworks (
 closes at 1 PM). Ride Don Trail to Taylor Creek Park. Ride Martin Goodman 
 Trail along the Beaches Boardwalk. Ride to Tommy Thompson Park then to Riv
 erdale Farm where the ride ends at 5 PM\, same time the farm closes.\n\nCl
 ose enough Route Map:\nhttps://www.komoot.com/tour/3362578674
