 10/fallcampus.jpg
CATEGORIES:School of the Arts, Media, Performance &amp\; Design
CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20260917
DESCRIPTION:We are thrilled to welcome prospective students and families t
 o visit our campuses in person at our 2026 Fall Open House ( https://futur
 estudents.yorku.ca/fall-open-house ).\nExperience all that AMPD ( https://
 ampd.yorku.ca/ ) has to offer as you discover our exciting programs\, welc
 oming community and hands-on learning opportunities.\nIn this dynamic even
 t at York University’s Keele campus\, guests will have the opportunity t
 o explore the School of the Arts\, Media\, Performance and Design ( https:
 //ampd.yorku.ca/ ). Tour our world-class facilities ( https://virtualtour.
 ampd.yorku.ca/yorku/home/tours/ )\, meet with AMPD professors\, students\,
  and staff\, and discover our innovative programs in fields such as Film a
 nd Media Arts ( https://ampd.yorku.ca/department-of-film-and-media-arts/ )
 \, Music ( https://ampd.yorku.ca/department-of-music/ )\, Visual Art and A
 rt History ( https://ampd.yorku.ca/department-of-visual-art-and-art-histor
 y/ )\, Design ( https://ampd.yorku.ca/department-of-design/ )\, Computatio
 nal Arts ( https://ampd.yorku.ca/department-of-computational-arts/ )\, The
 atre\, Dance and Performance ( https://ampd.yorku.ca/department-of-theatre
 -dance-and-performance/ ) and Integrative Arts ( https://ampd.yorku.ca/in
 tegrative-arts/?gad_source=1&gclid=Cj0KCQjw99e4BhDiARIsAISE7P_yUXVkAW7BmJB
 wXke9KGCK4981L0NcI1oiEoOVoVtY8wWZMjS1VcgaAkQhEALw_wcB&gclsrc=aw.ds ). Take
  advantage of this event to learn about unique creative opportunities\, fr
 om interdisciplinary collaborations to the latest in technology. You’ll 
 also have the chance to connect with our current student ambassadors while
  exploring our classrooms\, studios\, art galleries\, practice rooms\, and
  performance spaces. Plus\, get insights into the audition process and hav
 e your portfolio reviewed on the spot!\nAdmissions representatives will al
 so be available to guide you through the application process\, discuss fin
 ancial aid options\, and introduce you to essential student support servic
 es that will enhance your experience on campus. Bring all of your question
 s about life on campus\, clubs\, events\, athletics and more. We can’t w
 ait to see you!\nAMPD Fall Campus Day \nSaturday\, October 24\, 2026\n9:3
 0 a.m. – 2:30 p.m.\nAccolade West Building  ( https://maps.info.yorku.ca
 /2010/06/accolade-west/ )(Main Lobby)\n89 York Boulevard\, York University
  Keele Campus\nRegister HERE  ( https://www.eventbrite.ca/e/york-universi
 ty-fall-open-house-2026-tickets-1993137611249?aff=oddtdtcreator )\nComplim
 entary guest parking will be available in designated lots:\n\n\n\nStudent 
 Services Parking Garage #84\nArboretum Lane Parking Garage #80  \nYork B
 lvd. Lot #70 \n\n\n\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20261020
LOCATION:Accolade West Building\, York University @ 89 York Blvd. Toronto
PRIORITY:5
TRANSP:OPAQUE
