DESCRIPTION:Address:\nDaily Dose Coffee Bar\nToronto\, ON\nCanada\n\nWhat 
 began in London has now grown into a community of 2\,000+ members\, with o
 ver 200 sold-out events - from Gallery Strolls and Secret Salons to Dinner
  Clubs. Along the way\, our community has walked more than 10 million step
 s together across galleries\, cafés\, artist studios\, and cultural space
 s in London\, Amsterdam\, and Toronto✨\nThis Toronto chapter is led by o
 ne of our founding members Monique. She describes herself as an educator w
 ho’s endlessly curious about how people learn and connect. She finds joy
  in discovering new spaces\, ideas\, and creative communities — which mi
 ght explain why…\n\nHosted by Anh\, Monique Blemur & Nimi Collective
