SUMMARY:🤝 Fast Friends: Meet New People & Make New Friends | Board Game
 s | 25–45
DESCRIPTION:Toronto 20's to 50's Singles Social (4000+)\nYou can live in a
  city full of people and still wonder\, “Where do I actually meet new fr
 iends?”\n\nFast Friends makes that first step easy. Meet over 25 new peo
 ple through relaxed\, guided conversations\, discover shared interests and
  then stay for drinks and board games with the people you click with.\n\n
 🎲 Stout has 50+ board games to enjoy after the hosted rounds\, plus an 
 After Dark Special from 9–11 PM with $7 beers and $7 highballs.\n\n🎟
 ️ Book Online & Save: [https://toronto24thoct.eventbrite.co.uk](https://
 toronto24thoct.eventbrite.co.uk)\nEarly Bird: CAD $10\nRegular: CAD $15\nA
 t the Door: CAD $20 cash — to host Kruttika\nBooking in advance helps us
  plan the right space and group size and guarantees your place.\n\n🍻 Wh
 at to Expect\n7:00 PM – Welcome & Drinks\nMeet your host\, Kruttika\, gr
 ab a drink and settle in.\nComing alone? Most people do! Our host will wel
 come you\, make introductions and help you feel comfortable.\n\n🤝 7:30 
 PM – Fast Friends\nMeet a variety of friendly people through short\, gui
 ded conversations.\nNo awkwardly approaching strangers — we guide the co
 nversations and rotations\, so you can simply focus on getting to know peo
 ple.\n\n🎲 From 8:30 PM – Board Games & Mingling\nThe hosted rounds fi
 nish\, but the evening doesn't have to.\nStay for drinks\, play some easy 
 social board games with the people you've met\, or simply continue chattin
 g and getting to know your new connections.\n\n❤️ Why People Love Fast
  Friends\n✔ Meet over 25 new people in one evening\n✔ No awkwardly app
 roaching strangers — we guide the conversations\n✔ Most attendees come
  solo\n✔ Friendly hosts and a welcoming atmosphere\n✔ Common Ground Ch
 allenge to discover shared interests\n✔ Easy board games & socialising a
 fter the hosted rounds\n✔ Relaxed pub setting\n✔ Friendship-focused 
 — not a dating event\n\n👥 Who Is This For?\n✔ Ages 25–45\n✔ New
  to Toronto or long-time locals\n✔ Solo attendees welcome\n✔ Anyone lo
 oking to make new friends and expand their social circle\nWe're not a clos
 ed group — new faces are always welcome\, and you'll never feel like an 
 outsider.\n\n💳 Why We Use Tickets\nYour ticket helps us:\n• Organise 
 the right venue space\n• Support our local hosts\n• Create a safer\, m
 ore committed group experience\n• Deliver a well-organised evening for e
 veryone\n\n🌍 About Fast Friends\nFor over 10 years\, Fast Friends has b
 een helping people meet new people and build meaningful friendships in 30+
  cities around the world.\n\nOur mission is simple:\nTo make meeting new p
 eople easy\, relaxed and enjoyable.\nCome solo. Start with one conversatio
 n. Leave with new friends. ❤️
