SUMMARY: Ian Blurton’s Future Now Imperial Filth album release w/ Ace of 
 Wands / Tonnerre / Lego Money
DESCRIPTION:Presented with Sonic Boom\n\nPresented in partnership with TO
  Live\n\n\nIan Blurton's Future Now\n(Toronto // rock legends’ Imperial F
 ilth album release)\n\n\nAce of Wands\n\n(Toronto // gothic dream-rock)\n
 \n\nTonnerre\n\n(Ripon\, Québec // mysterious ‘70s rock)\n\n\nLego Money\
 n\n(Toronto // youth garage-rock duo)\n\n\nWavelength is excited to host 
 a gritty\, rock-centric night in celebration of Imperial Filth\, the new 
 release by Ian Blurton’s Future Now project. Featuring vintage gear and a
  powerhouse rhythm section\, Future Now is a manifestation of Blurton’s 4
 0+ years in the Canadian music scene (Change Of Heart\, C’mon\, Public An
 imal).\n\n\nThe seasonally appropriate Ace of Wands brings gothic-glam ae
 sthetics and dreamy fuzz\, alongside rural Quebec quintet Tonnerre’s blue
 sy invocation of nature and what lies beyond. Starting the night is tween
  brothers Lego Money: a beacon of hope for Gen Alpha everywhere.\n\n\nIns
 pired by this next wave of young musicians\, Wavelength is delighted to a
 nnounce the implementation of Pay What You Can youth pricing! Audience me
 mbers 25 and under can set their own ticket price at Wavelength shows: 25
  tickets will be available online and 25 tickets will be available at the
  door\, arrive by 7:30 to claim your spot.\n\n\nGet your pointer and your
  pinky finger ready for this multi-generational line-up of rockers!\n\n\n
 Poster by Jadyn Klassen\n\n
CATEGORIES:Concert,St.-Anne's-Parish-Hall
X-TKF-FEATURED-IMAGE:https://d3flpus5evl89n.cloudfront.net/6755f3e6a02aaf
 1c2599e757/6a891f4c558fb1b2fdbefbc9/scaled_1024.jpg
X-TKF-CUSTOM-PREVIEW:Presented with Sonic Boom Presented in partnership w
 ith TO Live Ian Blurton's Future Now (Toronto // rock legends’ Imperial F
 ilth album release) Ace of Wands...
LOCATION:St. Anne's Parish Hall\,651 Dufferin Street\, Toronto\, ON M6K 2
 B2\, Canada
CREATED:20260822T040223Z
DTSTAMP:20261024T043646Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260822T040319Z
TRANSP:OPAQUE
