 you're trying to build.\nBut we understand networking can feel intimidatin
 g. Sometimes you don't know who to approach\, what to say\, or how to turn
  a quick introduction into a genuine connection. We want to change that.\n
 Join us for TH3RDSPACE's annual networking event\, Beyond the Business Car
