 nDownload the ecoBoss app at blackstoneenergy.com/ecoboss ( https://blacks
 toneenergy.com/ecoboss/ ) and set up your account. Your Passport York emai
 l address will be used to enter the contest.\nSearch for York University
 ’s “Sustainability in Action” Challenge in the app.\nJoin a challeng
 e and earn points by submitting simple sustainable activities.\nComplete t
 he challenges by October 30\, 2026 at 11:59 p.m. ET to be entered into the
  draw.\n\nOpen to York students. No purchase necessary. For full details a
 nd the Official Contest Rules\, visit yorku.ca/sustainability/ecoboss-chal
 lenge ( https://www.yorku.ca/sustainability/ecoboss-challenge/ ).\n
