DESCRIPTION:Discover practical editing techniques to make your writing coh
 erent and cohesive. Learn how to revise your paper’s structure and sente
 nces to ensure every assignment is the best it can be.\nAt the end of each
  workshop\, you’ll receive access to a quiz\, which you will need to com
 plete within 72 hours of the workshop date. If you pass the quiz\, you wil
 l receive a badge\, which will be recorded on the Write Now! eClass site.\
 nIf you attend all four workshops and pass each workshop’s quiz within o
 ne academic calendar year\, you’ll attain a Certificate of Completion th
 at can be added to your resume and professional networking sites\, such as
  LinkedIn.\nJoin Here\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20261013
LOCATION:Online Zoom
ORGANIZER;CN="James Robertson":MAILTO:jroberts@yorku.ca
PRIORITY:5
TRANSP:OPAQUE
