SUMMARY:Maker's Club -Pumpkin Painting
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261027T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261027T190000
UID:6ab591e8ca248a0029183ee1@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:No seeds to scoop\, no gooey grime - just paint your pumpkin a
 nd have a great time!  Join us to paint a few pumpkins to help decorate y
 our home for Hallowe'en.  Spooky or silly\, bright or bold\, paint a pump
