CREATED:20260911
DESCRIPTION:Join us every Tuesday from September 15 to November 24\, 2:45 
 PM–4:00 PM\, for a guided 5K Walk or Run around the scenic trails near Y
 ork University’s Markham Campus!\nWhat’s the catch? There isn’t one!
  your goal is yours. Run the full 5K\, walk 5\,000+ steps\, beat your pers
 onal best\, or just get outside and move with a group.\nReady to join? Reg
 ister here to reserve your spot! Check-in and warm-up begin at 2:45 PM\, 
 with trail departure at 3:00 PM sharp.\n
