SUMMARY:Book Launch: Militants\, Mobsters and Mavericks - by Toronto
  Workers' History Project
LOCATION:901 St Lawrence Ave W
DESCRIPTION:More info:
  https://twhp.ca/book-launch-militants-mobsters-and-mavericks/\n\nHosted
  by Toronto Workers' History Project (https://twhp.ca)\n\nCelebrate the
  release of Militants\, Mobsters and Mavericks and discover the people and
  power struggles that helped build modern Toronto. Discover the stories of
  union leaders\, immigrant workers\, mobsters\, and politicians who
  clashed for control of Toronto’s booming construction industry—and
  the lasting impact they had on the city we know today.
END:VEVENT
