DESCRIPTION:Join other seniors at the Downsview branch every Wednesday aft
 ernoon for coffee\, crafts\, games\, and social activities!\nOctober 7:\nW
 hat's That Bird? A Beginner's Guide to Bird Identification\nOctober 14\n:
 \nVirtual Reality\nOctober 21: Art Workshop\nOctober 28: Musical Performan
 ce by Andy Fedely\nPlease note that there is no Senior Social program sc
