DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261028T153000
UID:6aa97f353dd190003e721e53@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Immerse yourself in the breathtaking beauty of autumn blooms/ 
 berries and bring their rich colors and textures to life on paper as cards
 . As the leaves change and nature puts on its most magnificent display\, t
 here's no better time to explore your artistic talents and create stunning
  floral masterpieces inspired by the vibrant hues of the season with help 
 of watercolour inks.\nThis workshop will be led by Parmeet Arora Bori.\n
 Drop-in\, no registration required.\nAll adults welcome.\nSpace is limited
 .\nProgram will be capped at the first 10 participants.
LOCATION:High Park\, Program Room
