CREATED:20260928
DESCRIPTION:Speaker: Winny Shen\, Associate Professor of Organization Stud
 ies\, Schulich School of Business\nYour commute could be more than just ge
 tting from point A to point B. In this session\, we’ll explore how commu
 ting can be transformed from a daily drain into a valuable part of your da
 y—whether as a time to decompress\, prepare for what’s ahead\, or simp
 ly enjoy a few moments to yourself. You’ll learn practical\, research-ba
 cked ways to make your commute more enjoyable and support your overall wel
 l-being.\n
