DESCRIPTION:The Faculty of Graduate Studies is hosting a session entitled 
 Dissertation Proposal Essentials. Join us!\nA strong dissertation proposal
  provides the foundation for a successful research project. A crucial acad
 emic milestone\, the proposal is also an opportunity to refine your resear
 ch questions\, establish the significance of your work\, and develop a cle
 ar plan for moving your research forward. This session explores the key el
 ements of an effective dissertation proposal\, including developing a rese
 arch rationale\, articulating your methodology\, organizing your ideas\, a
 nd aligning your goals with disciplinary expectations. Participants will g
 ain practical strategies for preparing a proposal that communicates the va
 lue and direction of their research with clarity and confidence.\nDate: We
 dnesday October 28\, 2026\nTime: 12:00-1:00 p.m. (ET)\nLocation: Virtual W
 orkshop via Zoom Webinar\nRegistration is required: Registration Form ( ht
 tps://yorku.zoom.us/webinar/register/WN_-9MpLwhdSn-5qhP94aJRrg )\n
