 1c2599e757/6ad3e61762b7c5607c7bf5bc/scaled_1024.jpg
X-TKF-CUSTOM-PREVIEW:"Cylinder Spectrum" & "Polygon Plexus" are two visua
 l art exhibitions by Toronto artist Angela Julian (Native Torontonian and
  OCADU graduate). Both shows are...
