DESCRIPTION:Unleash your inner artist at Mount Dennis Library! Join us for
  this step-by-step tutorial with acrylic paints while you learn how to pai
 nt a Dia de los Muertos sugar skull and have fun. Registration required\, 
 as space is limited. Please note that spots will be held for 10 minutes be
 fore being offered on a first-come first-serve basis.
