 k of the month. New club members are welcome! This month we are reading\nL
 ion Women of Tehran\nby Marjan Kamali\nIf you identify as a person with a 
 disability and require an accessibility accommodation to participate in th
 is program\, please contact Accessibility Services by email\, accessiblese
 rvices@tpl.ca\, or voicemail\, 416-393-7099\, to make a request. Please co
 ntact at least three weeks in advance.
LOCATION:Pape/Danforth\, Upstairs Program Room
