DESCRIPTION:BE YU Presents: The Barbershop\nA Black Men’s Wellness & Con
 versation Event\nAbout the Event\nJoin BE YU in collaboration with the Arc
 hives of Ontario for an evening centered on Black men’s wellness\, cultu
 re\, and community. Connect with others and engage in meaningful conversat
 ions in a welcoming space.\nWhat to Expect\n\nIlluminate Black Exhibit Tou
 r\nThe Barbershop Experience: Haircuts and open dialogue\nInteractive Keyn
 ote\nRefreshments\n\nImportant Information\n✂️ 2 attendees will be sel
 ected through a raffle to receive a free haircut!\nRegister here: https://
 docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSewaPCdJklqmOMTDvWH_k4Ee6GN9i64GRQt89RYie
 Q8xK1msA/viewform?pli=1 ( https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSewaPCd
 JklqmOMTDvWH_k4Ee6GN9i64GRQt89RYieQ8xK1msA/viewform?pli=1 )\n
