SUMMARY: Couples Clownselling
DESCRIPTION:Hunny\, this isn't working\, I think it's time we go to Coupl
 es Clownselling https://www.instagram.com/couplesclownselling/?hl=en !\n\
 n*Every show sold out in advance\, don't wait to grab tickets for our Tor
 onto Debut at The Rivoli!*\nJerry Springer's got nothing on us!\n\nAn eve
 ning of domestic blunders\, bloopers\, and baggage awaits as professional
  stand-up comedians and their partners take the stage to air out their di
 rty laundry\, while getting the best possible advice from the most (un)qu
 alified\, fully (not fully at all) licensed\, (non)professionals.\n\nAudi
 ences will also have the chance to write anonymous questions for the coup
 les before the show\, just to spice things up. Come for the laughs\, stay
  for the drama as we share a night (and maybe a few fights) you'll never 
 forget!\n\nThe show has been featured on the CBC\, Just For Laughs Vancou
 ver\, & the Georgia Straight. We have showcased Canada's top talent inclu
 ding several Juno Award Winners.\n\nAll ticket holders get a 10% discount
  off Rivoli meals https://www.rivolitoronto.com/menu that are purchased i
 n the front room (restaurant) before the show. Please come early for dine
 r before the show!\n\nEmail couplesclownselling@gmail.com mailto:couplesc
 lownselling@gmail.com with any questions!\n\nDoors 7:15\n\nShow 8:00\n\nS
 how is 19+
CATEGORIES:Comedy,Rivoli
