 1c2599e757/6abf0251ecf0e8b6535249ee/scaled_1024.jpg
X-TKF-CUSTOM-PREVIEW:Composer Lea Bertucci brings her newest piece for ar
 chaic flutes in 8 channels featuring master flautist Norbert Rodenkirchen
  to the ethereal environment at...
LOCATION:Church of the Holy Trinity\,10 Trinity Square\, Toronto\, ON M5G
  1B1\, Canada
CREATED:20261002T010107Z
DTSTAMP:20261024T043646Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20261007T183418Z
TRANSP:OPAQUE
