UID:6abae30696ec3a003ad6dec4@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Gain confidence with technology in this beginner-friendly seri
 es. Learn smartphone basics\, online safety\, useful apps\, and discover f
 ree digital entertainment and library resources. Join us in a welcoming en
 vironment where questions are encouraged and no experience is required. Te
 chnology made simple\, one step at a time.\nThursdays 2-3p\nm\nOct. 8 Usin
