 tration begins Oct 15\nPrerequisites:\nSome computer experience is require
 d\; the ability to navigate app menus\, browsers\, and desktop computing f
 eatures is desirable.\nInformation Collection Notice:\nThe personal inform
 ation on this form is collected by the Toronto Public Library under the Pu
