 se\, Passive\, too\, but with a Purpose.)\nUnsure about when to use Active
  Voice or Passive Voice in your academic essays? Come to this Thursday’s
  Grammar On! and learn how to use voice with purpose and confidence!\nNo R
 SVPs. Just click to join!\n
