DESCRIPTION:Address:\nCheck event page for more details.\n\nJoin us at Sho
 pify's Toronto office on Thursday\, Oct 29th for an evening of learning\, 
 networking\, and fun.\n🎯 Theme: The Real Work of Data Engineering: AI\,
  Scale\, and the Mistakes That Teach Us\nSome of the best engineering less
 ons come from the things that didn't go according to plan.\nWe are bringin
 g Toronto's engineering community together to explore the real work behind
  building data and AI systems: the technical decisions\, trade-offs\, chal
 lenges\, and lessons learned along the way.\nBecause increasingly\, the ha
 rdest problems don't sit neatly inside data engineering\, software enginee
 ring\, or…\n\nHosted by Vipul Choudhary & Rushika
