 solve that with each speaker opening the hood on a system that runs in pro
 duction today. You hear the problem\, see the solution and results.\nSpeak
 ers from Flinks\, Ada and AXL Labs and more to be announced.\nWhat happens
 \nFive live demos\, ten minutes each\nQuestions after each demo\nNetworkin
 g with other Toronto builders\nWho should come\nPeople who build or own GT
 M systems\nPeople who want to see how other teams build pipeline\nWe appro
 ve…\n\nHosted by Sean Whitestone & Yusuf Ahmed
