DESCRIPTION:In this group\, you’ll have the opportunity to connect with 
 fellow graduate students\, talk openly about the challenges and wins of ac
 ademic life\, and build practical tools for managing stress\, strengthenin
 g resilience\, and caring for your mental well-being. Whether you’re nav
 igating deadlines\, self-doubt\, isolation\, or simply looking for a place
  to feel grounded\, you are welcome here.\nAbove all\, this is a confident
 ial and supportive environment designed to help you feel heard\, understoo
 d\, and less alone as you move through your graduate journey. This will be
  a closed virtual group\, and there will be 5 sessions in total.\nThe Date
 s are as follows: Sept. 17\, Oct. 1\, 15\, 29\, and Nov. 12\nWith the foll
 owing times of each session: 2:30 pm -4:00 pm\nIf you are interested\, ple
 ase register below:\nGraduate Student Wellness Support Group – Fall 2026
  (Closed Group) – Fill out form ( https://forms.cloud.microsoft/r/Y95T48
 iq4H )\nThe Zoom link will be sent to you after you register above. If you
  have any questions\, please email gradwell@yorku.ca ( mailto:gradwell@yor
 ku.ca ).\n
