DESCRIPTION:20s 30s Toronto Social & Activities\n**NOTE:** You need a tick
 et to attend this event.\n\n**Tickets here:** https://www.eventbrite.com/e
 /north-york-dodgeball-singles-night-free-for-ladies-tickets-2003363978589?
 aff=oddtdtcreator&keep_tld=true\n\nCalling Toronto singles! Come mix and m
 ingle with other eligible singles\, then play some dodgeball! All skill le
 vels welcomed.\n\nLooking for a fun an unique way to meet other singles? J
 oin us for a fun night of socializing and fun dodgeball!\n\nArrive at 6:30
 pm to mix and mingle and warm up with drills and instructions\, then start
  playing dodgeball at 7:30pm. All skill levels are welcomed. This is meant
  to be a fun and casual event so we won't keep score or anything.\n\nWe wi
 ll explain all the rules once everyone arrives\, so just come in your gym 
 attire and get ready to throw some balls!\nBring an extra change of clothe
 s though\, because we are also planning to go to a nearby pub after for so
 me drinks too.\nThe suggested age range is 25-45. All are welcomed.\n\nSee
  you there!
