SUMMARY:Toronto Yorkville Singles Masquerade Party (Age 25-45)
DESCRIPTION:20s 30s Toronto Social & Activities\n**NOTE:** This is a ticke
 ted event.\n\n**Tickets here:** [https://www.eventbrite.com/e/toronto-york
 ville-singles-masquerade-party-age-25-45-free-for-ladies-tickets-200123109
 9089?aff=oddtdtcreator&keep_tld=true](https://www.eventbrite.com/e/toronto
 -yorkville-singles-masquerade-party-age-25-45-free-for-ladies-tickets-2001
 231099089?aff=oddtdtcreator&keep_tld=true)\n\nDress up\, grab a mask\, and
  mingle! Join Toronto’s chicest singles for cocktails\, connections & po
 ssible romance! Drink included.\n\nGet ready for a night of **mystery\, co
 cktails\, and new connections** at our Toronto Yorkville Singles Masquerad
 e Party!\n\nWe're pulling out all the stops and **aiming to make this our 
 biggest singles night ever**. Join hundreds of Toronto singles for an unfo
 rgettable evening at the elegant **The Powder Room**\, a stylish cocktail 
 lounge in the heart of Yorkville.\n\n✨ **Come dressed to impress**\n🎭
  **Masquerade theme** — bring your favourite mask\, or we'll provide one
  at no charge if you don't have one\n🍸 **One drink included with your t
 icket** \\- Martini\\\, mixed drink\\\, or pop\\. Arrive by 9pm\\.\n\nSee 
 someone you like? Give them a Like or a Pass on your phone using our exclu
 sive web app\, and if the feeling is mutual we will notify you the next da
 y. Make sure to sign up for a profile on www.15firstdates if you'd like to
  participate.\n\n**The bigger the crowd\, the more people there are to mee
 t. Help us make this our biggest singles night yet!**
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/20s-30s-toronto-social-activities/eve
 nts/316990894/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20261015T031039Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20261015T031039Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
