 g you’ve ever seen or heard before\, where professional wrestling collide
 s head-on with the soaring grandeur of opera!\n\nNo prior opera or pro wr
 estling knowledge required. This is a family-friendly spectacle for all a
 ges\, with extraordinary athleticism and soaring vocals launched straight
  from the top rope!\n\nMeet “Dangerous” Danie\, a fearless Valkyrie/Sopra
 no driven by destiny and the desire to compete for the enchanted Champion
 ship belt\, granting its bearer glory and miraculous abilities beyond the
  stage and the ring.\n\nCheer her on as she leads a cast of world-class\,
  high-flying performers in a symphony of chaos and athletic artistry.\n\n
 Standing in her path are the biggest\, baddest\, and raddest Junction Cit
 y Wrestlers https://www.junctioncitywrestling.com/ .\n\nWill Danie ascend
  to Valhalla and claim the championship… or will she be silenced before t
 he final curtain falls?\n\nFind out at OPERAMANIA III
