 dead (omg!)\, be the detective trying to solve the case\, the accomplice h
 elping cover it up\, or the medic trying to keep people innocent.\nLet me 
 set the stage:\n“ Katniss Everdeen survived two Hunger Games and an enti
 re war\, only to be murdered here tonight. Aelin Ashryver Galathynius\, Qu
 een of Terrasen\, and…\n\nHosted by Wine About Books
