DESCRIPTION:Address:\nSupermarket Bar and Variety\nToronto\, ON\nCanada\n\
 nHalloween at Supermarket 🎃\nHalloween at Supermarket with a live band 
 to start the night\, followed by a DJ until close.\nCome in costume and re
 ady to dance.\nDetails\nOct 31 · 9 PM–2:00 AM\nSupermarket\, Kensington
  Market\n19+ with valid ID\nFull bar\nCostumes encouraged\nTickets\nPrices
  increase as each release sells out. Buying earlier gets you the lowest pr
 ice.\n\nHosted by Jojo Rosenzweig
