X-SOURCE-ID:yohomo
SUMMARY:Beyond the veil
DTSTART:20261031T235500
DTEND:20261031T235500
UID:397e75927f336500194d5d0809afe5c7@yohomo.ca
DESCRIPTION:/lineup Momocita @BIP @Bathala @MsMyles Halloween. Venture Bey
 ond the Veil\, dig into the deepest depths of your psyche and dress up as 
 the very thing that haunts your dreams. We wanna see your nightmares come 
 to life! The one who lurks in your shadows\, the one who torments your tho
 ughts\, the baddie that you never let see the light of day. Join us on Oct
 ober 31st to exorcise your demons out on the dance floor with our bewitchi
 ng line up. We know most of you will not even be leaving your houses until
  11pm so our doors will be opened at 12am! For those of you who have other
  plans\, you’re in luck because we will be partying until 6am. ‍ Remem
 ber\, no costume\, no entry! We wish to boogie among kindred ghouls and co
 ntour our fears together during this intimate celebration of transcendence
 . ‍
LOCATION:TBA\, Address TO BE ANNOUNCED
URL:https://www.yohomo.ca/event/beyond-the-veil
X-SOURCE:YOHOMO
END:VEVENT
