SUMMARY: Scaryoke! Halloween-themed karaoke night at Cassette
DESCRIPTION:Sing your heart out this Halloween with a special edition of 
 live band karaoke\, hosted by Good Enough Live Karaoke https://www.instag
 ram.com/goodenoughlivekaraoke?utm_source=ig_web_button_share_sheet&stkn=Z
 DNlZDc0MzIxNw== . Take the stage and perform your favourite songs with a 
 full live band backing you and the crowd singing along. Come dressed for 
 the occasion for a Halloween costume contest\, with the first-place winne
 r receiving a complimentary one-night stay at Gladstone House. The event 
 runs from 8 PM to midnight with no cover\; however\, reservations are enc
 ouraged.\n\nReservations: cassetteto https://www.cassetteto.com/reservati
 ons
CATEGORIES:Karaoke,Concert,Cassette,Competition
