 ks\, Chorley Park\, Integral House\, and Riverdale Farm. The route will be
  on city streets\, so please wear shoes or boots appropriate for the weath
 er. There are three parking lots within about 500m of the start of the wal
 k\, but all seem to have fairly high Sunday rates. There may be street par
 king available on nearby side streets\, but the best choice may be to use 
