DESCRIPTION:Address:\nTrinity Bellwoods Park\nToronto\, ON\nCanada\n\nHost
 ed By: Seek Discomfort\nMost people spend a weekend in the places they alr
 eady know. That’s the comfortable version. This is the other one.\nThis 
 October and November\, Seekers around the world are turning their cities i
 nto a playing field. A scavenger hunt- part city exploration\, part Seek D
 iscomfort challenge\, entirely unpredictable. You get a list\, people you
 ’ve probably never met\, and a few hours to find out what you’re actua
 lly willing to do in public.\nAnd across every city taking part\, two Seek
 ers will win the new Yes Theory Atlas!\nAbout the prize:\nThe Atlas is ten
  years of Yes Theory\,…\n\nHosted by Seek Discomfort & 3 others
