DESCRIPTION:Think you know your trivia?\nJoin us in London for an exciting
  trivia night and support team York U as we compete against alumni from un
 iversities across Canada! \nWhether you’re a trivia buff or simply look
 ing to connect with fellow Canadian alumni\, we’d love to have you join 
 us for an evening of friendly competition\, great conversation\, and commu
 nity spirit. Come test your knowledge\, show your York pride\, and help us
  bring home the title.\nTickets are $15 CAD and include refreshments. If y
 ou’d like to represent York U on the competing team\, please contact Jas
 on Knox (jknox2@yahoo.com). Otherwise\, please register using the link bel
 ow to join us for the evening.\nDate: Tuesday\, Nov. 3\nTime: 6–8 p.m.\n
 Location: The Champion Pub\, Notting Hill Gate\, London\n
