SUMMARY:Chess For Life: Seniors Social
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261104T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261104T143000
UID:6ada6187377296003a4dd6b6@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:The Chess Institute of Canada invites you to join our Chess fo
 r Life program — a fun and engaging chess program for seniors of all ski
 ll levels.\nWhether you are a seasoned player or new to the game\, enjoy 
 friendly matches\, sharpen your strategy\, and connect with others in a re
 laxed\, supportive environment.\nCome make your move!\nRegistration requir
 ed.
LOCATION:Cedarbrae - Closed\, Program Room
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6ada6187377296003a4dd6b6
