SUMMARY:Campus Clash: Smash Bros Edition
DTSTART:20261104T180000Z
DTEND:20261104T210000Z
DTSTAMP:20261014T154700Z
UID:MEC-6d6cd6cf541904ea96487fed916f6d2c@events.yorku.ca
