SEQUENCE:3
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://events.yorku.ca/wp-content/uploads/2026/1
 0/LibCal.png
CATEGORIES:Markham Campus
CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20261014
DESCRIPTION:Campus Clash: Smash Bros Edition is a student-run\, casual-com
 petitive esports tournament hosted by the Athletics & Recreation departmen
 t at York University’s Markham Campus. The event features Super Smash Br
 os. Ultimate on Nintendo Switch\, beginning with interactive rotation roun
 ds and concluding with a Grand Finals showdown.\nOpen to all Markham Campu
 s students\, regardless of experience level\, this tournament is designed 
 to foster community\, friendly competition\, and peer connection through s
 hared gaming culture. Whether you are an experienced player looking to rea
 ch the top of the leaderboard or are joining for a casual match\, the even
 t offers an inclusive and welcoming format for everyone.\nSPACE POLICY: Th
 is event is held in a specialized technology space. Food and open beverage
 s are strictly prohibited inside the facility.\nThis program is offered at
  the MK 3050 Gaming Lab on:\nFall Tournament: Wednesday\, November 4\, 202
 6\, from 1:00 p.m. to 4:00 p.m.\nStudent arrival\, check-in\, registration
  confirmation\, and controller checks will take place between 12:45 p.m. P
 lease arrive during this check-in period to confirm your position on the t
 ournament tracking sheet before the event begins at 1:00 p.m.\nCheck-in cl
 oses strictly at 1:00 p.m. Late arrivals may lose their reserved tournamen
 t spot.\nRegistration for each tournament will open fourteen (14) days bef
 ore the event date.\nPlease register only if you can attend. If you can no
  longer participate\, cancel your registration so the space can be made av
 ailable to another student.\nMARKHAM – Markham Experiences – York Recr
 eation ( https://reconline.yorkulions.ca/Program/GetProgramDetails?courseI
 d=1be423d9-27e8-41df-b34b-fb53c55fa55c )\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20261021
LOCATION:Markham Campus(MK 3050 Gaming Lab)
PRIORITY:5
TRANSP:OPAQUE
URL:https://events.yorku.ca/events/campus-clash-smash-bros-edition/
X-SOURCE:York University
END:VEVENT
