DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261104T200000
UID:6ad24bece06996003a83ecba@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Laughter is good for the soul! Explore creative exercises and 
 games to connect\, create and laugh! Want to get ready for a presentation 
 at school? Prep your acting skills for an audition? Or feel more confident
  in general? Or do you just want to have some fun!? Join us!Hosted by You 
 Amaze You (Y.A.Y)\, an organization that uses improv and interactive exper
 iences to help young people build confidence\, connection\, and well-being
 .\nDrop in. No registration required. This workshop is part of the Teen So
 cial Health and Wellness programming. Generously supported by The Estate o
 f Claudia Krawchuk.
LOCATION:Wychwood
