SUMMARY:The Toronto Comedy Showcase - Singles Night  (ticketed event)
DESCRIPTION:20s 30s Toronto Social & Activities\n**NOTE:** This is a paid 
 event. You need a ticket to attend.\n\n**Tickets here:** https://comedybar
 .ca/shows/the-toronto-comedy-showcase-singles-night\n\nSingle and ready to
  mingle? We’re bringing together some of the city’s funniest comedians
  to share their most hilarious\, cringe-worthy\, and relatable stories abo
 ut love\, relationships\, and the wild world of dating in Toronto. Whether
  you’re happily single\, tragically single\, or just looking for a great
  night out with friends\, this is the show for you.\n\nExpect a night pack
 ed with sharp observations\, wild dating app disasters\, and plenty of cro
 wd work. Who knows? You might even meet someone—or at least leave feelin
 g a lot better about your own love life.\n\n7pm: Singles mix and mingle\n8
 pm: Show\n\nGrab your tickets\, grab a drink\, and get ready to laugh unti
 l it hurts. Because if we can’t find love\, we can at least find the pun
 chline!
