SUMMARY:EXCEL BASICS 1
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261106T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261106T123000
UID:6ad7be3ff4d1423e2ce3e841@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Excel Basics 1\nThis is an introductory class on Microsoft Exc
 el for beginners with little or no Excel experience. This class will cover
  the following Excel topics:\nCreate\, save and print workbooks and worksh
 eets\nEnter data and use basic functions: Sum\, AutoSum and Average\nCours
 e Objective:\nUpon completion of this class\, students will be able to use
  Excel at a basic level.
