UID:6ab58908a5dbde002aa6fcf7@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Explore the journey from first idea to published book. Award w
 inning author Lisa de Nikolits will lead this workshop on finding story id
 eas\, transforming real life into thrilling fiction\, self-editing\, and n
 avigating the changing publishing industry. Participants will gain practi
 cal tools and inspiration to move forward with their creative projects. N
 o previous writing experience required.\nFree program. Register for a remi
 nder. Drop-ins are welcome.\nFor more information\, please call Maria A. S
 hchuka Library at 416-394-1000.
LOCATION:Maria A. Shchuka\, First floor
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6ab58908a5dbde002aa6fcf7
