DESCRIPTION:Emo Night Painted Lady! Playing all the hits from your favori
 te bands during your Warped Tour days!\n\nGrab your tickets for Toronto's
  premier pop punk and emo tribute band\, Eyes Like Static.\n\nDust off yo
 ur skinny jeans\, throw on those vans and come out to Emo Night on Ossing
 ton at The Painted Lady in Toronto on November 7th. If you're a fan of po
 p punk and emo covers this event is for you!\n\nWith over 2 hours of live
  music from Eyes Like Static\, playing hits from bands such as Blink 182\
 , Green Day\, My Chemical Romance\, Paramore\, Jimmy Eat World\, Sum 41\,
  Foo Fighters and so much more\, you won't want to miss this event!
