DESCRIPTION:Supporting Your Journey: Academic Milestones and Immigration C
 ompliance\nMonday\, November 9 | 10:00–11:30 a.m.\nGraduate students are
  expected to meet key academic milestones throughout their programs—but 
 what happens when those milestones are missed?\nCo-hosted by the Faculty o
 f Graduate Studies (FGS) and York International\, this session will explor
 e:\n\nKey academic milestones and their significance\nStudy permit conditi
 ons and immigration compliance\nWhat students need to know to make proacti
 ve and informed decisions\n\nParticipants will also learn about available 
 resources to help them stay on track academically and maintain their immig
 ration status.\nRSVP: Registration Link ( https://yorku.zoom.us/webinar/re
 gister/WN_OYCFXoEbTa-PxNQ6MrX5UQ )\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20261008
LOCATION:Online Webinar
ORGANIZER;CN="Faculty of Graduate Studies":MAILTO:fgsinfo@yorku.ca
