SUMMARY:Movies From Around the World
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261109T173000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261109T200000
UID:69bc63824dacf581ff8330e9@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join us every second Monday of the month (unless specified oth
 erwise) as we bring the world to you through the power of cinema! Beginnin
 g with a small introduction\, we will be hosting screenings from various m
 ovies from around the world\, so we hope to see you there!\nAugust 10th:\n
 City of God\n(Brazil)\; Runtime: 2h10m\; Rating: R\nSeptember 14th:\nBoy\n
 (New Zealand)\; Runtime: 1h27m\; Rating: 14A\nOctober 19th:\nOldboy\n(Sout
 h Korea)\; Runtime: 2h\; Rating: R\nNovember 9th:\nKung fu hustle\n(China/
 Hong Kong)\; Runtime: 1h39m\; Rating: 14A
LOCATION:Lillian H. Smith\, Basement program room
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69bc63824dacf581ff8330e9
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Adults
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Toronto Public Library \u2014 Young Adults": "https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6ab2b31a607483003828c1ed"}
X-SOURCE-ID:tpl_young_adults
SUMMARY:Building Your Own Website for Small Business Owners and Newcomer E
 ntrepreneurs
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261109T173000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261109T190000
UID:6ab2b31a607483003828c1ed@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:In today's world\, having a personal website is essential for 
 many reasons and especially to support careers and small businesses. This 
 session is a condensed overview of building a WordPress website from start
  to finish - covering the basics of domain and hosting\, the WordPress das
 hboard\, plugins\, design and branding\, and adding an online shop with Wo
 oCommerce. This program is catered to newcomer entrepreneurs but is open
  to anyone looking to build a website.\nBy the end\, participants will hav
 e a clear understanding of what's involved\, how long it takes\, and wheth
 er building their own website is the right fit for them. No experience nee
 ded.
LOCATION:Deer Park\, Room 204
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6ab2b31a607483003828c1ed
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Young Adults
END:VEVENT
