 nciples with theoretical knowledge in areas such as transformational and o
 rganizational leadership\, caring and narrative pedagogies\, global and lo
 cal policy\, and human health experiences.\nEvent Details\n\nDate: Novemb
 er 10\, 2026\nTime: 6:00–7:00 p.m.\nLocation: Virtual (Zoom)\nJoin lin
 k: yorku.zoom.us/s/94632597264 ( https://yorku.zoom.us/s/94632597264 )\n\
