SUMMARY:Tea & Movies - Mister Roberts (1955)
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261111T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261111T160000
UID:6acfe082f34d34366b3cf691@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join us every month for a free afternoon movie.\nThis month's 
 movie:\nMister Roberts\nA comedy-drama about life aboard a Navy cargo ship
  in Pacific waters during World War II. The monotonous non-combat duty of 
 a fun-loving crew is enlivened by a feud between the petty\, intolerant ca
 ptain and an impetuous\, highly-respected cargo officer whose continuous e
 fforts to get a transfer to combat duty are blocked by the captain.\nLight
  refreshments served before the movie.
LOCATION:Hillcrest\, Auditorium
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6acfe082f34d34366b3cf691
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Older Adults
