SUMMARY:Make A Will with the Ontario Bar Association
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261111T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261111T190000
UID:6ace803ea85a2c00337f3aaa@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:November is Make a Will Month and TPL is delighted to host the
  Ontario Bar Association. Learn about the importance of having a will and 
 powers of attorney for you and your family. Mitchell Rattner\, a member of
  the\nOntario Bar Association\nwho practices Trusts and Estates Law will s
 peak about the elements of a will\, what happens if you don’t have one\,
  what are powers of attorney\, why they are important and special consider
 ations to keep in mind when preparing your estate and care plans. Note\, t
 his program is for general information only\, not for drafting individual 
 wills.
LOCATION:Forest Hill\, Program Room
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6ace803ea85a2c00337f3aaa
