SUMMARY:Dianne Scott: Writing Sabotage\, a Toronto Island Christine Lane M
 ystery
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261112T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261112T153000
UID:6ab03542101eb7003f31b7e4@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Dianne Scott\, a Canadian award-winning author of the Christin
 e Lane Mystery series\, will give a talk\, slide presentation\, and a book
  reading.\nDiscover how Dianne has created her Toronto Island historical m
 ystery series\, with a focus on the fourth book\,\nSabotage\n. She will sh
 are her writing process and inspirations\, followed by a Q&A\, book raffle
 \, book sales\, and book signing.
