SUMMARY:Protect Yourself from Financial Scams
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261113T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261113T143000
UID:6aaabe12129d8e0031f2adc7@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:November is Financial Literacy Month.\nA representative from t
 he\nCanada Revenue Agency (CRA)\nwill discuss how to recognize scams and f
 raud\, the different methods used by scammers\, how to protect your person
 al and financial information\, and what steps to take if you believe you h
 ave been targeted.\nRegistration encouraged\n. Drop-ins are welcome until 
 capacity is reached.
LOCATION:North York Central Library\, Room 1\, 2nd floor
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6aaabe12129d8e0031f2adc7
