SUMMARY: Lizzy Clarke & Amy Jean Live In Concert
DESCRIPTION:Friday\, November 13\, 2026 · 7:30–9:30 PM\nSt. Aidan’s in th
 e Beach Church · 2423 Queen St E\, Toronto\n\nTickets: BUY TICKETS https:
 //www.tickettailor.com/events/lizzyclarkemusic/2439438\n\nJoin Amy Jean a
 nd Lizzy Clarke for an intimate evening celebrating two exciting new bodi
 es of original music.\n\nThe evening opens with Amy Jean\, performing son
 gs from her new album Living Imperfection — a collection of music that em
 braces the beauty\, messiness\, and honesty of being human.\n\nThen\, Liz
 zy Clarke takes the stage for an hour of music from Amaleen\, her new and
  evolving project. Written after returning to songwriting following sever
 al years away\, Amaleen brings together folk\, jazz\, soul and pop influe
 nces in a growing collection of original songs.\n\niamjeanymusic.com http
 s://iamjeanymusic.com/\n\nlizzyclarkemusic.ca https://lizzyclarkemusic.ca
 /\n\nWith a short intermission between sets\, there will be time to grab 
 a drink\, connect with friends\, and settle into the beautiful surroundin
 gs of St. Aidan’s.\n\nTwo artists. Two new releases. One special night of
  live original music.\n\nDoors: 7:30 PM\nAmy Jean: 7:45 PM\nIntermission:
  8:15 PM\nLizzy Clarke: 8:30 PM
CATEGORIES:Concert,St.-Aidan’s-in-the-Beach-Church
