SUMMARY: 14th SooRyu Festival - Symbiosis II
DESCRIPTION:14th SooRyu Festival - Symbiosis II\n\n14th SooRyu Dance Fest
 ival — Symbiosis II\n\n\nThe Korean Dance Studies Society of Canada (KDSS
 C) presents the 14th SooRyu Dance Festival — Symbiosis II\, a two-day cel
 ebration bringing together artists from Korean\, Indigenous\, and diverse
  Canadian artistic traditions through dance\, music\, and cultural exchan
 ge.\n\nExploring how different cultures\, bodies\, and artistic voices co
 nnect through movement\, Symbiosis II invites audiences to experience a r
 ange of traditional and contemporary performance practices.\n\nSunday\, N
 ovember 15 — Main Performance | 4 PM - Meridian Arts Centre Studio Theatr
 e\n\nExperience an afternoon of live performance featuring Mi Young Kim D
 ance Company\, Culture & Arts Creative Research Institute J.D.C. (South K
 orea)\, U Dance Company (South Korea)\, William Lau\, Mafa Thomas\, Johna
 than Morin\, Hyang Ok Kim\, Eun Ji Kim\, and Hayun Jeong.\n\nFrom Korean 
 traditional performance to contemporary dance and diverse movement practi
 ces\, the festival creates a space for artists and audiences to encounter
  different perspectives and discover connections through the performing a
 rts.\n\nSaturday\, November 14 — Free Workshop Series - Meridian Arts Cen
 tre Upper Gallery\n\nDiscover different artistic traditions through a ser
 ies of free workshops at the Meridian Arts Centre's Upper Gallery. Partic
 ipants can explore Korean creative dance\, K-Pop choreography\, African r
 hythm and movement\, beginner tap dance\, Chinese Opera makeup\, and Kore
 an sangmo dance and janggu drumming.\n\nThese workshops offer an opportun
 ity to learn from artists working across different cultural and movement 
 traditions. Registration is required.\n\n\nSee our full festival schedule
  at www.koreandance.net http://www.koreandance.net\n\n  * Dates: November
  14–15\, 2026\n  * Venue: Meridian Arts Centre\, 5040 Yonge Street\, Nort
 h York\, ON\n  * Main Performance: Sunday\, November 15\, at 4 PM\n  * Ti
 ckets: Purchase tickets through Ticketmaster: www.ticketmaster.ca/event/1
 000654ECA552214 https://www.ticketmaster.ca/event/1000654ECA552214\n  * F
 ree Workshop Registration: Register through: forms.gle/jAEp1z5F27icwgj27 
 https://forms.gle/jAEp1z5F27icwgj27\n\n\nPresented by the Korean Dance St
 udies Society of Canada (KDSSC)\, the SooRyu Dance Festival supports the 
 presentation and exchange of Korean dance and other artistic traditions w
 ithin Canada's diverse cultural landscape.\n\nJoin us in exploring the co
 nnections between cultures\, traditions\, and artistic voices through the
  universal language of movement.
CATEGORIES:Dance---Performance---Theatre,Meridian-Arts-Centre,Workshop
X-TKF-FEATURED-IMAGE:https://d3flpus5evl89n.cloudfront.net/6755f3e6a02aaf
 1c2599e757/6adba494f1c2349eec37f818/scaled_1024.jpg
