CREATED:20261019
DESCRIPTION:Think you’ve got what it takes to Spin to Succeed? Join Stud
 ent Success & Advising Peer Mentors for an interactive Financial Literacy 
 Month game where you’ll spin the wheel\, answer financial literacy trivi
 a\, and compete for prizes. Learn about funding opportunities\, OSAP\, stu
 dent accounts\, tax supports\, campus employment\, and other resources ava
 ilable to help York students achieve financial success. \n
