SUMMARY:Astronomy and the Cosmos: Galaxy Formation
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261116T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261116T200000
UID:6ad61ace9dbc2b002c8f90dc@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a discussion on galaxy formation by\nDr. Chloe Che
 ng\n.  Attendees of this program will learn about how galaxies are formed\
 , how galaxies evolve over time\, and how scientists study galaxies.  Dr. 
 Cheng is a Research Excellence Postdoctoral Fellow at Department of Astron
 omy and Astrophysics at the University of Toronto.  Her research focuses o
 n the evolution of galaxies and star formation.
LOCATION:North York Central Library\, Room 2/3\, 2nd Floor.
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6ad61ace9dbc2b002c8f90dc
