UID:6ad3a4fb377296003a4ca07d@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:For people who are new to cell phones and want a basic underst
 anding of how to use them. No previous experience is required. In this cou
 rse we will look at:\nThe parts of a cell phone\nSafety tips for using you
 r phone\nSkills such as turning off your ringtone\, taking a picture\, sen
 ding a text\, reading a QR code\, how to use Wi-Fi and cellular date and 
 downloading an app\nResource handout provided.\nInformation Collection Not
