X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Events": "https://events.yorku.ca/events/world-fisheries-day/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:events
SUMMARY:World Fisheries Day
DTSTART:20261118T050000Z
DTEND:20261119T050000Z
DTSTAMP:20261019T214200Z
UID:MEC-e03fa839212850ef81d52ee81dd1d7b5@events.yorku.ca
RECURRENCE-ID:20261118T050000Z
SEQUENCE:3
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://events.yorku.ca/wp-content/uploads/2026/1
 0/Screenshot-2026-09-30-at-3.35.56-PM-edited.png
CATEGORIES:SDG Month,Sustainability
CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20261019
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate World Fisheries Day with the York University Office 
 of Sustainability!\nJoin us in Central Square to learn about sustainable f
 isheries and how aquatic invasive species affect fisheries in the Great La
 kes. Discover how your everyday food choices can make a difference for our
  oceans and waterways.\nThis event supports SDG 14: Life Below Water\, one
  of the least promoted Sustainable Development Goals at Ontario universiti
 es.\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20261019
LOCATION:Central Square\, Keele Campus\, York University
