 erler Beads\nWednesday\, November 11: DIY Press-On Nails\nWednesday\, Nove
 mber 18: Glass Photo Magnets\nWednesday\, November 25: DIY Charm Bracelets
 \nWednesdays in November\, 3:30 - 7 pm\nThis program is part of Youth Hub 
