DESCRIPTION:Ever wonder why stretching feels so good\, or why one deep bre
 ath can change your whole mood?\nWellness Unplugged is a laid-back worksho
 p where teens can dig into the science and history behind yoga and Pilates
 .\nNo experience\, no equipment\, no pressure. Come ready for honest conve
 rsations\, journaling\, and hands-on activities that give you real tools f
 or everyday life. Hosted by the Villij\, a Toronto-based wellness company 
 rooted in mindful movement and community connection.\nDrop in. No registra
 tion required.\nThis workshop is part of the Teen Social Health and Wellne
 ss programming. Generously supported by The Estate of Claudia Krawchuk.
