DESCRIPTION:Planting bulbs in the fall will bring glorious rewards in your
  spring garden. A\nToronto Master Gardener\nwill give advice on what to pl
 ant\, how to plant them and yes\, even a few pointers on squirrels! At the
  end of the program\, bulbs will be given out to attendees\, while supplie
 s last.\nSuitable for gardeners of any skill level\, with any kind of outd
 oor space.\nRegister & you will receive a reminder email\, or drop in!\nAl
 l are welcome!\nInformation Collection Notice:\nThe personal information o
 n this form is collected by the Toronto Public Library under the Public Li
 braries Act\, sections 20(a)\, 20(c)\, and 20(d). The information will onl
 y be used for event and program registration\, delivery and evaluation. Qu
 estions about how the library handles your information can be directed to 
