X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Meetup Toronto Ai Machine Learning Data Science": "https://www.meetup.com/toronto-ai-machine-learning-data-science/events/316617433/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:meetup_toronto_ai_machine_learning_data_science
X-SOURCE:Meetup: Toronto AI & ML
UID:event_316617433@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20261024T043624Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261119T120000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261119T140000
SUMMARY:Nov 19 - Visualizing and Debugging Hugging Face's LeRobot Data
DESCRIPTION:Toronto AI\, Machine Learning and Computer Vision Meetup\nThis
  workshop is a hands-on tour of what actually breaks when you load real Le
 Robot datasets\, and how Voxel51's native LeRobot support in FiftyOne catc
 hes it.\n\n**Date\, Time and Location**\n\nNov 19\, 2026\n9:00 AM - 10:00 
 AM PST\nOnline. **[Register for the Zoom!](https://voxel51.com/events/lero
 bot-workshop-november-19-2026)**\n\nRobot learning data doesn't look like 
 the data that trains most vision-language models. It's temporal\, low-dime
 nsional in the parts that matter most\, embodiment-specific\, and expensiv
 e to collect\, and increasingly\, it's shipped in Hugging Face's LeRobot f
 ormat. But packaging robot data consistently isn't the same as being able 
 to see it: episodes hide broken metadata\, silently dropped sensor modalit
 ies\, and mismatched schemas between robots that look identical on paper.\
 n\nStarting from the core differences that make robot data hard (temporal 
 structure\, proprioception\, action grounding\, embodiment heterogeneity\,
  data scarcity)\, we'll move into live debugging: a metadata bug that brok
 e multiple dataset imports\, sensor streams that vanish without an error\,
  and two robots running an identical benchmark whose data is structurally 
 incompatible. By the end\, you'll know what to check before you trust a Le
 Robot dataset\, and how to actually look inside one.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/toronto-ai-machine-learning-data-scie
 nce/events/316617433/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260918T224858Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260918T224858Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
