DESCRIPTION:Workshop 7: It’s not that pizzazz-y\, I’m out of pizzazz\n
 A lot of us are confused about when to use “that” and when to use “w
 hich”. “Which” might sound fancier in a sentence\, but it’s not al
 ways your best grammatical choice. Come to this week’s Grammar On! and 
 learn how – and when – to use “that” and “which” with purpose 
 and pizzazz.\nNo RSVPs. Just click to join!\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20260925
LOCATION:Online (Zoom)
