UID:6a945cd7b20478002996b659@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:This is a program for parents and caregivers with children fro
 m birth - 6 years. Families have the opportunity to socialize while childr
 en develop new skills in an early learning environment.\nThis is a drop-in
  program for children ages 0-6. Co-sponsored with EarlyON\, Malvern Family
  Resource Centre.
