 oundersrc.com/](http://podcast.foundersrc.com/)\nLinkedIn [http://linkedin
 .com/company/foundersrc/](http://linkedin.com/company/foundersrc/)\nStrava
  [http://strava.com/clubs/foundersRC](http://strava.com/clubs/foundersRC)\
 nWebsite [http://foundersrc.com/](http://foundersrc.com/)
