 erland | 3ROC | Latex Barbie\n\nAdvance Tickets: https://wiggleroomtoront
 o.com/event/animal-instinx-hector-romero-nyc/\nEarly Wiggler: $25\nThe Wi
 ggler: $30\n\nTHE WILD IS CALLING. ARE YOU READY TO UNLEASH IT?\n\nGet re
 ady to go WILD as Animal Instix returns for its 4th annual takeover! It's
  time to shed your inhibitions\, embrace your animal instincts\, and let 
