 UMES. UNTAMED ENERGY.\n\nPull out your leopard spots\, tiger stripes\, fu
 rry fits\, wild accessories\, and your most outrageous animal-inspired lo
 oks. Whether you're a fierce feline\, a sneaky snake\, a wild wolf\, or a
 n entirely new species\, this is your chance to get creative and unleash 
 your wild side. Expect wild beats\, untamed energy\, and a dance floor fu
 ll of creatures of the night.\n\nNo cages. No inhibitions.\n\nLET YOUR IN
 NER ANIMAL OUT TO PLAY.\n\nAdvance Tickets: https://wiggleroomtoronto.com
