UID:6ad7f450fee2d21deb24a82a@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:November is Make a Will Month and TPL is delighted to host the
  Ontario Bar Association. Learn about the importance of having a will and 
 powers of attorney for you and your family. A member of the\nOntario Bar 
 Association\nwho practices Trusts and Estates Law will speak about the ele
 ments of a will\, what happens if you don’t have one\, what are powers o
 f attorney\, why they are important and special considerations to keep in 
 mind when preparing your estate and care plans. Note\, this program is for
  general information only\, not for drafting individual wills.\nPlease reg
 ister for an email reminder and for us to anticipate crowd size. Drop-ins 
 welcome if space permits.\nInformation Collection Notice:\nThe personal in
 formation on this form is collected by the Toronto Public Library under th
