SUMMARY:Seniors' Social - Be Scam Smart!
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261124T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261124T150000
UID:6adba7959d27a0004552e7d7@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Calling all older adults! Come join us at Morningside library 
 every month\, on the last Tuesday.\nEnjoy a variety of topics\, guest spe
 akers\, lively conversation\, & fun activities!\nNovember's social will be
  a presentation by Canada Revenue Agency (CRA) - Be Scam Smart!\nThis is a
 n interactive information session to share information on recognizing var
 ious CRA-related scams. Learn how to spot a scam\, steps you can take to 
 protect yourself from scams\, and what to do if you're a victim of a scam.
 \nLight refreshments will be served!  Drop in!
LOCATION:Morningside\, Program Room
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6adba7959d27a0004552e7d7
