SUMMARY:GTApreneurs November 24\, 2026 Vaughan Business Networking Event
DESCRIPTION:Toronto Women in Business Networking Group (TWIB)\n\\*\\*To at
 tend\, you must **PURCHASE A TICKET** here: https://gtapreneurs.com/networ
 king-events-vaughan\n\nJoin us at an exciting Business Networking Event in
  Vaughan (1 block north of Toronto) on Tuesday November 24 where you can m
 eet potential clients and referral partners\, learn something new\, enjoy 
 a meal and promote your business!\n\n* **EVENT TIME:** 5:00-8:00pm\n* **FO
 OD SERVED:** 5:00-6:00pm\n* **VENUE:** Improve Canada\, 2nd floor auditori
 um\n* **ADDRESS:** 7250 Keele St\, Vaughan\, ON (Between Steeles Ave W. an
 d 407)\n* **PARKING:** Free\, onsite. Park on the NORTH SIDE of the buildi
 ng off of Snidercroft Rd\n\n**\\*\\*DIRECTIONS TO FIND THE ROOM:** Walk th
 rough entrance M\, go straight ahead until you get to the main aisle. Stra
 ight ahead will be a staircase. If you prefer to take the elevator\, make 
 a right at the main aisle\, go down a few stores and you will see it on th
 e left.\n\n**EVENT ITINERARY:**\n\n* **5:00-6:00pm:** Open networking\, fo
 od buffet\, visit exhibitor booths\n* **6:00-6:10pm:** GTApreneurs welcomi
 ng presentation\n* **6:10-6:30pm:** Guest Speaker Presentation: Chris Webb
 \, ***"Your Reputation\, Their Risk."***\n* **6:30-7:00pm:** Exhibitor Int
 roductions + member Elevator Pitches\n* **7:00-8:00pm:** Open networking\,
  visit exhibitor booths\n\n**TICKETS**\n\n* **GTApreneurs' Referral Group\
 , Exhibitor and Mega Networking Members:** Free\n* **Non-members:** $25 in
  advance or $29 on event day\n\nNot a GTApreneurs Member? Go here to view 
 our memberships and register: https://gtapreneurs.com/business-networking-
 memberships\n\n**QUESTIONS ABOUT THE EVENT?**\nCall or text **Tammy** at (
 416) 522-7770 or info@gtapreneurs.com.\n\nThis event will feature Guest Sp
 eaker **Chris Webb**\, CEO\, IT Works Co. Chris is a technology and AI str
 ategist challenging business leaders to think bigger\, move faster\, and g
 row. As CEO of IT Works Co and Sunshine ai\, with 25+ years of experience\
 , he’s helping small business owners protect what’s important so they 
 can innovate confidently.\n\nContact **Chris** at (416) 657-4010 and visit
  [www.itworksco.com](www.itworksco.com) to learn more about his services.\
 n\n**EXHIBITORS:**\n\n* **Abhishek Basak**\, Clerk Tech\, www.clerk-tech.c
 om\n* **Balbir Pabila**\, PPLSI\\~LegalShield\, https://bkpabila.legalshie
 ldassociate.com\n* **Brian Pho**\, Oasis LLP\, www.oasisllp.ca\n* **Moiz U
 r Rehman\,** Allstate\, www.agents.allstate.ca/on/newmarket/17725-yonge-st
 -n/moiz-ur-rehman\n* **Sonia Kurmey**\, Arbonne\, www.soniakurmey.arbonne.
 com\n\n**\\*Want to stand out?** Visit www.gtapreneurs.com/exhibitor to bo
 ok your exhibitor table\n\n\\*We will EMAIL you the GUEST CONTACT SHEET th
 e day after the event by 5pm. If you don’t receive it in your inbox\, pl
 ease check your SPAM/JUNK folder. Note: You must attend the event to recei
 ve the guest contact sheet.\n\n**Want 1-1 help with your business?** Learn
  about Tammy Defoe's business coaching services here: https://gtapreneurs.
 com/about and https://gtapreneurs.com/business-coaching-toronto
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/downtown-toronto-women-in-business-me
 etup/events/317085497/
