DESCRIPTION:\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nThinking about s
 tudying science in Canada? Join this exclusive webinar to explore York Sci
 ence’s diverse programs\, cutting-edge research opportunities\, scholars
 hips\, and career pathways. Find out how York University can help you achi
 eve your academic and professional goals while benefiting from a supportiv
 e and welcoming student community.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n
 \n\n\n\n\nREGISTER HERE ( https://yorku.zoom.us/webinar/register/WN_bzURLz
 vXTMW0YittLbZlSQ#/registration )\n\n \nWe will be using Zoom to host our 
 information sessions. If you have any questions\, please email science@yo
 rku.ca ( mailto:science@yorku.ca )\n
