SUMMARY:Grid Drawing
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261125T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261125T170000
UID:6acfd608a85a2c00337f87ed@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Registration required.\nBreak a big picture into small\, easy 
 puzzle squares. Instead of drawing a whole animal or cartoon at once\, you
  look at just one little box at a time and copy what you see. It is like m
 agic: by taking it one tiny square at a time\, you build a big\, amazing m
