DESCRIPTION:Join us for a lively and fun discussion about the selected boo
 k of the month. New club members are welcome! This month we are reading\nT
 he Berry Pickers\nby Amanda Peters\nIf you identify as a person with a dis
 ability and require an accessibility accommodation to participate in this 
 program\, please contact Accessibility Services by email\, accessibleservi
 ces@tpl.ca\, or voicemail\, 416-393-7099\, to make a request. Please conta
 ct at least three weeks in advance.
