DESCRIPTION:Dance Innovations 2026 features the new choreographic works f
 rom fourth year BFA dance majors performed by students engaged in all leve
 ls of York’s programs in Dance.\nStudents are guided by faculty at every
  level of creation\, performance\, lighting design and production and it i
 s the students who collaborate to run Dance Innovations\, staged in the M
 cLean Performance Studio\, November 25 – 28.\nDance Innovations\nSeries 
 A: November 25 (6:30 p.m.) | November 27 (8:30 p.m.) | November 28 (5:00 p
 .m.)\nSeries B: November 25 (8:30 p.m.) | November 26 (6:30 p.m.) | Novemb
 er 28 (7:00 p.m.)\nSeries C: November 26 (8:30 p.m.) | November 27 (6:30 p
 .m.) | November 28 (9:00 p.m.)\nFeatures new choreographic works by fourth
  year students with student lighting design and production support.\nLocat
 ion: McLean Performance Studio ( https://facilities.ampd.yorku.ca/faciliti
 es/mclean-performance-studio/ )\nTickets ( https://secure1.tixhub.com/york
 u/online/index.asp ): $25.00 (regular) | $15.00 (students)\nAdvance (until
  Sunday Nov 22nd): $ 20.00\nLimited Seating\nBox Office: 416-736-5888 | am
 pd.yorku.ca/boxoffice ( http://ampd.yorku.ca/perform/boxoffice )\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20260924
LOCATION:McLean Performance Studio\, 244 Accolade East Building\, York Uni
 versity @ 83 York Blvd. Toronto
PRIORITY:5
TRANSP:OPAQUE
