 ly for the most up-to-date information. During Fall Reading Week\, Peer-As
 sisted Study Sessions\, Tutoring\, and Office Hours are typically not offe
 red. If a session is scheduled during this period\, details will be commun
 icated by the course instructor and posted in eClass.\nLearn more about PA
 SS ( https://students.yorku.ca/PASS ).\n
