DESCRIPTION:In this class\, you’ll learn the basics of using an Apple de
 vice. You’ll explore its different parts\, understand what an operating 
 system is\, and learn how to turn it on. You’ll also get familiar with t
 he home screen\, how to adjust settings\, and how iCloud and storage work.
LOCATION:Northern District\, Learning Centre
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6ad26f5d96ec3a003adb0fe8
