DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261202T140000
UID:6ac111d8e8cf1c005cb05567@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Toronto-based guitarist Karla García invites you on a musical
  journey from Baroque elegance to the soul of Latin America. Featuring wor
 ks by Bach\, Barrios Mangoré\, Víctor Jara\, Luiz Bonfá\, and Chilean c
 omposers Antonio Restucci and Juan Antonio Sánchez\, alongside original c
 ompositions from her upcoming debut album\, this concert celebrates the ti
 meless voice of the classical guitar — intimate\, soulful\, and deeply h
 uman.​\nDrop-in\; no registration required.\nKarla Garcia playing guitar
LOCATION:Downsview\, Lower Level Auditorium
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6ac111d8e8cf1c005cb05567
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Older Adults
END:VEVENT
