UID:6aad8784a5dbde002aa593a8@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Sidecar78 is a Toronto-based saxophone quartet with a songbook
  containing everything from jazz and ragtime to classical and contemporary
  standards in arrangements that showcase the outstanding musicianship of t
 he ensemble. The members of Sidecar78 - three retired music teachers and a
  record company executive - have shared their enthusiasm for the unique a
 nd cosmopolitan sound of the saxophone since establishing the quartet in 2
 016.\nNo advance registration nor free tickets required. All ages welcome.
