UID:6ad6a7b996ec3a003adba8b5@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Elders of the 2SLGBTQ+ community\, this space is for you! Join
  us for three workshops facilitated by the artist Ali Zargari Ouroozaki\, 
 and expand your ability to understand\, appreciate\, and create art.\nEach
  session takes a different focus\, beginning with understanding the primar
 y elements of visual art\, then analyzing their interrelations\, and final
 ly understanding their material properties. Participants will have the opp
 ortunity to apply these lessons with their own creations.\nCommunity allie
 s are welcome. All necessary art supplies as well as light refreshments wi
 ll be provided.\nRegistration is recommended\n. Drop-in space will be avai
 lable until room capacity is reached.\nThursday\, November 19\nth\n& 26\nt
 h\n\; December 3\nrd\n\, 2:30-3:30pm.\nInformation Collection Notice: The 
