UID:6a2c1a177550c8bf9f5cd7b5@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Learn how to drive safely in the winter and what to do tips on
  collision.  This is a collaboration program with Senior Persons Living Co
 nnected (SPLC)\, Seniors And Law Enforcement Together\, and the Ontario Mi
 nistry of Transportation.\nRegistration starts on Nov 6\, call SPLC at 416
