SUMMARY:Youth Hub: Watercolour Painting
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261204T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261204T180000
UID:6adb92539d27a0004552df20@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Explore the world of watercolour painting! Experiment with col
 ours\, blending\, and different techniques to create your own unique artwo
 rk. Whether you’re painting dreamy landscapes\, colourful patterns\, or 
 abstract designs\, this is a chance to relax\, get creative\, and express 
 yourself. No experience needed\, and all materials will be provided!\nThis
  program is part of Youth Hub service. Youth Hubs are a welcoming place fo
 r teens after school and in the summer\, where helpful staff are always av
 ailable. Free\, nutritious snacks are offered daily. Drop by a branch with
  a\nYouth Hub\nor call the branch to find out more.\nThe Mount Dennis Yout
 h Hub is for youth that are 13-17 years old in grades 8-12.
LOCATION:Mount Dennis
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6adb92539d27a0004552df20
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Teens
END:VEVENT
