 nd Control on Saturday\, December 5th from 11am – 5pm when we’ll be hosti
 ng 35+ artists\, artisans and authors celebrating all aspects of the seas
 on\, especially those that are dark\, macabre\, and spooky.\n\nOur market
  is (mostly) kid-friendly. Our gorgeous venue is close to parking and tra
 nsit\, is fully accessible\, and has an ATM on site. The bar will be open
  for customers to enjoy a beverage while they shop.\n\nAdmission is free.
 \n\nMore information: http://www.torontodarkartsmarket.com
