 sites: Computer for Beginners 1 & 2 or basic mouse and keyboarding skills\
 nRegistration is required. Please register online or by calling 416-393-77
 00. Space is limited.\nInformation Collection Notice:\nThe personal inform
 ation on this form is collected by the Toronto Public Library under the Pu
 blic Libraries Act\, sections 20(a)\, 20(c)\, and 20(d). The information w
