SUMMARY:Youth Hub: Boba Drink Making with Chef Yumiko
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261209T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261209T180000
UID:6adbc1ae035faf0033de9749@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Chef Yumiko leads a hands-on workshop to make the popular Asia
 n beverage\, Brown Sugar Milk with Boba. Participants will learn to prepar
 e and use the classic ingredients including milk\, molasses and tapioca pe
 arls to make this visually pleasing and sweet drink. Chef Yumiko will also
  provide a brief history of Boba and why it's so popular globally.\nThis p
 rogram is part of Youth Hub service. Youth Hubs are a welcoming place for 
 teens after school and in the summer\, where helpful staff are always avai
 lable. Free\, nutritious snacks are offered daily. Drop by a branch with
  a\nYouth Hub\nor call the branch to find out more.\nThe Mount Dennis Yout
 h Hub is for youth that are 13-17 years old in grades 8-12.
LOCATION:Mount Dennis
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6adbc1ae035faf0033de9749
