DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261212T133000
UID:6abaf9f229c3d600332c4b5a@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:This program introduces children to beginner computer programm
 ing and fosters the development of essential STEM skills. Delivered in col
 laboration with Macaulay Centres for Children\, the initiative focuses on 
 promoting educational growth and enhancing future employment opportunities
 \, particularly for children in marginalized communities. Participants wil
 l engage in hands-on coding activities\, make new friends\, and have fun i
 n a supportive. Space is limited\, and advance registration with a commitm
 ent to attend the full session is required.
LOCATION:Woodview Park\, Program Room
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6abaf9f229c3d600332c4b5a
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — School Age
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Toronto Public Library \u2014 Teens": "https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6ac7f0c229c3d600332e9eaf"}
X-SOURCE-ID:tpl_teens
SUMMARY:FRESH Movie Saturdays
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261212T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261212T130000
UID:6ac7f0c229c3d600332e9eaf@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:This program helps people stay active\, make friends\, learn n
 ew skills\, and have fun. Meet new folks\, build connections\, and tell us
  about programs and services you would like to see in the neighbourhood!\n
 Come join us every Saturday for screenings of your favourite movies. In ad
 dition to this\, enjoy cuddles with a therapy dog! Therapy dog Goose visi
 ts Fort York Branch on alternate Saturdays from 11:00AM-12:00PM.\nWe'll b
 e showing the following films:\nOct 10 - Planes\, Trains and Automobiles\n
 Oct 17 - Toy Story 5\nOct 24 - The Absent Minded Professor (1961)\nOct 31
  - Hotel Transylvania\nNov 7 - Herbie the Love Bug (1968)\nNov 14 - Afric
 a-An Cats\nNov 21 - The Odd Life of Timothy Green\nNov 28 - Little Big Le
 ague\nDec 5 – Dog Man\nDec 12 – HitPi\nDec 19 - A Muppet Christmas Ca
 rol\nJan 2 - The Incredible Journey (1963)\nJan 9 - Trolls Band Together\n
 Jan 16 - Pete's Dragon\nJan 23 - Turner and Hooch\nJan 30 - Soul\nFeb 6 - 
 The Odd Life of Timothy Green\nFeb 13 - The Parent Trap (1961)\nFeb 20 - E
 scape to Witch Mountain (1975)\nFeb 27 - Never Cry Wolf\nDrop-ins are welc
 ome.\nThis program is in collaboration with\nGerstein Crisis Centre's F.R.
 E.S.H. initiative\n.
LOCATION:Fort York\, Urban Living Room
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6ac7f0c229c3d600332e9eaf
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Teens
END:VEVENT
