 Live Music\n\,  hosted by local poets and musicians.\nJoin us and enjoy t
 hese warm\, supportive and talented afternoons:\nJanuary 10\, February 21\
 ,March 21\, April 18\, May 16\,\nJune 13\, July 11\, August 8\, September 
 19\,October 31\,\nNovember 14\, December 12.
LOCATION:Barbara Frum
