DESCRIPTION:Make your very own edible slime!\nTap into your five senses\, 
 get creative\, and learn about mindfulness while crafting a delicious trea
 t that you can take home! Ingredients used to make edible slime include gl
 uten-free\, halal\, vegan\, and allergen-friendly options.    All ingredie
 nts and equipment will be provided.\nThis workshop is part of the Teen Soc
 ial Health and Wellness programming. Generously supported by The Estate of
  Claudia Krawchuk.
