 Tiramisu. Chef Yumiko will provide and explain all the ingredients and tak
 e the participants through a simple step-by-step process of creating a del
 icious ready-to-eat dish.\n*Food allergy notice: Please be aware that ingr
 edients used in this program include dairy\, egg and decaffeinated espress
 o. Certain food ingredients may cause allergic reactions in some people.\n
