DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261224T120000
UID:6acfd600901b02002cc26e97@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Registration required.\nIn Dr. Seuss's classic How the Grinch 
 Stole Christmas!\, a grumpy creature with a heart two sizes too small plot
 s to ruin the holiday for the cheerful residents of Who-ville by stealing 
 all their gifts\, food\, and decorations\, only to discover that Christmas
  comes anyway and the true meaning of the season runs much deeper.\nFor al
 l ages.
LOCATION:Malvern\, Community Room
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6acfd600901b02002cc26e97
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Preschool
END:VEVENT
