DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261228T180000
UID:6ad8ebbde06996003a84f92d@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Choose from an array of activities. You can choose to play you
 r favourite board game or try a new one with your friends. Monopoly\, Jeng
 a\, Chess\, UNO\, Scrabble\, and many more. You can also engage with vario
 us small crafts and hang out with friends.\nThis is a drop-in program.\nTh
 is program is part of Youth Hub service. Youth Hubs are a welcoming place 
 for teens after school and in the summer\, where helpful staff are always 
 available. Free\, nutritious snacks are offered daily. Drop by a branch 
 with a\nYouth Hub\nor call the branch to find out more.
LOCATION:Fairview\, In Room 301 (Youth Hub)
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6ad8ebbde06996003a84f92d
