DESCRIPTION:Jenga\, TIC TAC TOE\, Connect4\, we have it! Come with your fr
 iends and try out all the different board games in our youth hub.\nThis pr
 ogram is part of Youth Hub service. Youth Hubs are a welcoming place for t
 eens after school and in the summer\, where helpful staff are always avail
 able. Free\, nutritious snacks are offered daily. Drop by a branch with 
 a\nYouth Hub\nor call the branch to find out more.\nThe Mount Dennis Youth
  Hub is for youth that are 13-17 years old in grades 8-12.
