X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Toronto Public Library \u2014 Older Adults": "https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/697e3bbccbf6405d3565de39"}
X-SOURCE-ID:tpl_older_adults
SUMMARY:Woolly Wednesdays
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261230T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261230T160000
UID:697e3bbccbf6405d3565de39@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Yearning for yarn? Join our afternoon needlecraft circle! Whet
 her you are a seasoned crochetier or picking up a set of knitting needles 
 for the first time\, everyone is welcome to share techniques\, enjoy frien
 dly conversation\, and learn a new skill.  Connect with fellow craftspeopl
 e as you work on your project. We will have some supplies available for be
 ginners\, but please feel free to bring your own. Drop-in\; no registratio
 n required.
LOCATION:York Woods\, 1st Floor Meeting Room
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/697e3bbccbf6405d3565de39
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Older Adults
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Toronto Public Library \u2014 Older Adults": "https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6abc17ba377296003a48773b"}
X-SOURCE-ID:tpl_older_adults
SUMMARY:Housing Help
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261230T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261230T170000
UID:6abc17ba377296003a48773b@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Drop in and work one-on-one with staff from The Housing Help C
 entre (THHC) to determine your housing needs\, connect you to other govern
 ment services\, and to match you with landlords across the city. THHC work
 s with both individuals and families in the City of Toronto to find and ma
 intain affordable\, safe housing.\nThe Housing Help Centre can be contacte
 d at 416-285-8070 or at shhc.ca.
LOCATION:Albert Campbell\, Front Entrance
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6abc17ba377296003a48773b
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Older Adults
