SUMMARY:Youth Hub: Candle Making
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261230T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261230T180000
UID:6adbba6c9d27a0004552eea9@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Get creative and make your own scented candles! Explore differ
 ent fragrances using essential oils and personalize your candle with your 
 favourite scents and designs. Learn the basics of candle making while crea
 ting something unique to enjoy at home or give as a gift. All materials wi
 ll be provided!\nThis program is part of Youth Hub service. Youth Hubs are
  a welcoming place for teens after school and in the summer\, where helpfu
 l staff are always available. Free\, nutritious snacks are offered daily.
  Drop by a branch with a\nYouth Hub\nor call the branch to find out more.
 \nThe Mount Dennis Youth Hub is for youth that are 13-17 years old in grad
 es 8-12.
LOCATION:Mount Dennis
