  construct different projects using K'nex.\nWant to join last minute? Drop
 -ins are welcome if space is available!\nInformation Collection Notice:\nT
 he personal information on this form is collected by the Toronto Public Li
 brary under the Public Libraries Act\, sections 20(a)\, 20(c)\, and 20(d).
