SUMMARY:Family Literacy Day Puppet Show
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20270123T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20270123T144500
UID:6ac53e51c6cddb004595d6e7@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate Family Literacy Month and bring the whole family. Wa
 tch the classic tale\nToo Much Noise\n\, performed as a puppet show!\nRece
 ive a take away craft to make at home.
LOCATION:Pape/Danforth\, 2nd Floor\, Program Room
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6ac53e51c6cddb004595d6e7
